{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Progress: fix pushed as Gerrit 3323 (patch set 1, `230645c455f`, on `7c3cb5e9a4f`).\n\n**Root cause.** `ensure_fresh` read the 60 s throttle marker only after `repo_root_or_none()` (which runs `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` when `REBAR_ROOT` is unset) and `git rev-parse --verify <branch>`. Every exit between those calls and the age check is a side-effect-free return, so the fix reads the marker first and leaves the rest of the order unchanged. A new helper, `_sync_marker_age`, keeps `ensure_fresh` at complexity 10.\n\n**Per-caller git spawns with a throttled marker** (throwaway two-repo store; every git `Popen` attributed to its calling frame):\n\n| request | caller | before (`REBAR_ROOT` set / unset) | after |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `show_ticket` | `reads.py:ensure_fresh` `rev-parse --verify` | 2 / 2 | 0 / 0 |\n| `show_ticket` | `_config_resolvers.py:repo_root_or_none` (inside `ensure_fresh`) | 0 / 2 | 0 / 0 |\n| `show_ticket` | `_config_sources.py:repo_root` (tracker/config lookup) | 0 / 5 | 0 / 5 |\n| `list_tickets` | `ensure_fresh` total | 1 / 2 | 0 / 0 |\n| `list_tickets` | `_config_sources.py:repo_root` | 0 / 2 | 0 / 2 |\n| audit `GET /`, 1 ticket | `ensure_fresh` total | 5 / 10 | 0 / 0 |\n\nThe remaining `repo_root` discovery is out of scope and filed as carbonous-bipartisan-ammonite.\n\n**Tests.**\n- `tests/unit/test_read_freshness_git_spawns.py` is new. On `b7c6ed6c834` it had 4 failures and 3 passes; with the fix all 7 pass.\n- Targeted read, freshness, audit and store modules: 746 passed, 9 skipped, and 1 load-dependent failure. That failure was then reproduced on base and filed as weakwilled-catchable-cattle.\n- `make lint` and `make typecheck` exit 0.\n- Default tier of `make verify`: 20,785 passed, 3 failed. All 3 are preexisting and tracked:\n  - 2 facade tests fail on unmodified `origin/main` too, under bald-diagnostic-cricket and fibre-beamy-angora.\n  - The fetch-race positive control passes in isolation on both arms; it is tracked as numbing-hasty-shark.\n- Integration tier (`integration and not live`): 202 passed, 2 skipped."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793827910545250001,"uuid":"015c162f-5c83-4eab-b976-cffc47c3c323"}